        "code": {
          "text": "Left ear symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Left ear sore for 3 days with a dull ache and occasional sharp pain when chewing; decreased hearing and blocked sensation. No discharge, tinnitus, vertigo, or upper respiratory symptoms. Possible mild night sweats; no clear fevers."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left ear examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Left external auditory canal mildly erythematous without oedema or debris; tympanic membrane intact and slightly dull without bulging. No mastoid tenderness or lymphadenopathy. Right ear examination documented as NAD."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left knee symptoms and functional impact"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Left knee pain for 5–6 days, now severe; worse with weight bearing and stairs. Difficulty getting on and off the couch, almost fell, and unable to fully weight bear. No trauma. Patient feels washed out and reports poor sleep. Wife reports he has been much less mobile this week and will not complain."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left knee examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Obvious effusion; warm and erythematous compared with the right knee; very tender, especially medially and suprapatellarly. Markedly reduced range of motion, flexion approximately 45 degrees with almost no full extension. Passive movement painful. Unable to weight bear without support. Distal neurovascularly intact; other joints NAD."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Relevant exposure and history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Uses cotton buds; possible dirty water exposure. Reports no history of gout or inflammatory arthritis."
      }
